{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Adonai gives the word</b> — joined to \"the women who proclaim.\" The meaning: HaShem upholds the words of the women who proclaim, in their songs." "<b>A great army</b> — of Israel, for their desire and all their request is that He strengthen Israel. And this is what it says: \"The kings of armies flee, flee from before you.\" The meaning: the kings of the armies of the nations flee from before you, and they flee repeatedly."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 68, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:07.177692859Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}